description of purpose be included on the same "printed page" as the
notice, for easier identification within third-party archives.

Inclusion of the [URL] line is voluntary. If no URL is available or you
prefer not to include one, you may delete that line, along with the word
"at" that precedes it, before applying the notice to your Work; doing so
does not affect the validity or scope of the License.


